    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 One of four Guardian Knights assigned to protect Prince Frintezza, he was sacrificed and sold to Halisha by the unwise Prince in an attempt to save his own skin. In his lifetime, he was called Valkyrie Alectia of Flames because of his beautiful appearance, excellent skills and fiery temper. Demons Lv. 9 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Demons. M. Atk. +10 Atk. Spd. +5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +2% Resistance to Dark +10% P. Def. -5% Resistance to Holy -10% Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. Bow Lv. 9 Bows Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
